        "original_id": "3e884aa7-9f9e-5189-922c-64c9de38ff74",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chuck Taylor, Trevor Mann, Ricochet, Brandon Walker\n- Organizations: Old School Wrestling Training Academy, Chaos Pro Wrestling\n- Places: Hardin, Kentucky, Brookport, Illinois\n- Topics: wrestling training, professional wrestling careers, friendship\n\nFacts:\n- Chuck Taylor began wrestling training at age 15 under Brandon Walker at the Old School Wrestling Training Academy in Hardin, Kentucky.\n- Trevor Mann was born on October 11, 1988.\n- Chaos Pro Wrestling was a newly restarted promotion in Brookport, Illinois, where Chuck Taylor began his friendship with Ricochet.\n- Trevor Mann is an American professional wrestler best known by the ring name Ricochet.",
